# The BERT-family operator set of ort-server v0.1.0-musl .. v0.1.2-musl: the union over BERT, DistilBERT,
# RoBERTa (covers XLM-RoBERTa, CamemBERT), DeBERTa v1/v2, ELECTRA, ALBERT and ModernBERT, sequence and token
# classification, converted with convert_onnx_models_to_ort (with and without runtime optimisation).
ai.onnx;1;Not
ai.onnx;7;Cos,Sin
ai.onnx;11;Range
ai.onnx;13;Abs,Cast,Concat,Equal,Erf,Expand,Gather,Gemm,MatMul,Neg,ReduceSum,Slice,Softmax,Sqrt,Squeeze,Tanh,Transpose,Unsqueeze
ai.onnx;14;Add,CumSum,Div,Mul,Relu,Reshape,Sub
ai.onnx;15;Shape
ai.onnx;16;LessOrEqual,Where
ai.onnx;17;LayerNormalization
ai.onnx;18;Split
